{"id":"n02jp505l5unxr2euundzp6w2","title":"2026年Q3酒店业财报：降价的没换来客人，涨价的守住了？","originalTitle":null,"summary":"2026年第三季度，华住、首旅、锦江和亚朵等酒店集团的RevPAR表现分化，整体RevPAR仅小幅增长或持平，但同店RevPAR普遍下降。华住和首旅的成熟店RevPAR分别下降4.4%和4.2%。尽管价格策略不同，但涨价的酒店守住了入住率，而降价的酒店则流失了客人。同时，酒店新开门店数量增加，尤其是通过加盟模式，导致RevPAR增长。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15345494.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T05:07:50.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T05:38:45.613Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T05:38:45.613Z","category":"stock-cn","tags":["财报"],"score":47,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(ST商业研究社)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"earnings","name":"财报"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}